      "id": "heldout-aligned-restore-drill:seg:0",
      "text": "Quarterly restore drill. Auditors want evidence by the end of the month."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-aligned-restore-drill:seg:1",
      "text": "I'll run it. Restore last night's production snapshot into the isolated drill account."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-aligned-restore-drill:seg:2",
      "text": "When?"
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-aligned-restore-drill:seg:3",
      "text": "Thursday the 12th, starting 10:00 Central. It takes about three hours."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-aligned-restore-drill:seg:4",
      "text": "And what counts as a pass?"
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-aligned-restore-drill:seg:5",
      "text": "The restore finishes within four hours, row counts match the snapshot manifest for every table, and the app logs in against it."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-aligned-restore-drill:seg:6",
      "text": "Good. Write it up in the drill log by Friday the 13th, with screenshots."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-aligned-restore-drill:seg:7",
      "text": "Drill log by Friday the 13th. Yes."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-aligned-restore-drill:seg:8",
      "text": "I'll forward it to the auditors the following Monday."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-aligned-restore-drill:seg:9",
      "text": "Sounds good."
    }
  ],
